nexy - Gemini to nex proxy
Author: vladimyr

Nexy sets up a Gemini server capable of fetching nex content and
convert it to text/gemini. This makes it possible to use existing
Gemini browsers that support proxying such as Amfora [1].

[1]: https://github.com/makew0rld/amfora

Instructions:
- npm install
- mkdir certs
- npm run gencert
- npm start

Here is how to use Amfora:
- Add the following line to /etc/hosts: 0.0.0.0 nexy.localhost
- Open ~/.config/amfora/config.toml and under [proxies] add:
nex = "nexy.localhost:1965"

Credit:
- nexy written by vladimyr
- gencert script written by Omar Polo
